WEBVTT

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:12.060
There is an unforeseen element.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:17.180
They have foiled the attempts of the Chimera Animas twice already.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.260
That is true.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.910
Go, Quiche.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
Go and collect data on their strengths.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:25.040
Understood.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:33.200
W-Wuahhhhh! How did this happen?!

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.530
I overslept by 30 minutes, dressed and ate breakfast in a hurry.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.660
I would have been on time too… but geez!…

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:43.500
after I walked 700 meters I noticed I forgot to bring something!

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.940
At this rate, I’ll surely be late for school!

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:56.820
Ouch…

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:58.850
I’m sorry!

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:04.960
I’m so sorry!

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:07.460
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:11.390
This wouldn’t have happened if I’d been looking where I was going.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.100
It’s alright, it’s alright.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:14.880
Like this!

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:18.650
It’s my fault too that I crashed into you.

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:22.070
I’m really sorry.

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.980
I’m sorry too. Are you alright?

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:30.860
Is something wrong?

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:31.860
Um, nothing.

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:37.300
She seems to be very timid and polite.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:39.560
Ummm… those bags…

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.780
Retasu, what’s taking you so long?

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.980
Hurry up! We’re leaving!

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:44.950
I’m coming.

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:47.860
I’m sorry. Goodbye.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.300
I didn’t have time to be doing this!

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:08.140
I’ve made it…

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.920
You seem pretty tired lately, Ichigo.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.760
It’s more like, she’s almost dead.

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:24.810
Sigh… I’m still sleepy and tired.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.360
And all my joints hurt…

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:34.580
All of this… Everything… is the fault of those DEVILS!

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:46.560
Welcome! Please enjoy yourself at Café Mew Mew!

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:50.480
They’re calling you,
at the table in the back.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.090
Yup! Coming right up!

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:57.300
Clean table three.

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.520
Coming!!

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:01.390
Get the orders for table six.

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:02.650
Yes…!

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:06.890
Hurry up and bring some water for the customers.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.250
I’m sorry, I’m sorry.

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:12.520
Bring those dishes back too, will you?

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.090
Yes, I’m coming!

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:18.800
Wait a minute, you’re not working at all! On the top of that, you’re relaxing with tea!

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:21.820
Well, that can’t be helped.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:26.790
I always take afternoon tea at this hour.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.500
You can’t just decide that!

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:33.090
Minto says a lot of things, but she doesn’t do anything at all!

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:34.900
And then there’s Shirogane…

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:37.630
Yo! Are you done?

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:41.700
Yes… By the way, why don’t you help out a bit?

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:44.560
When you’re done,
go and search for aliens.

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:45.530
So hurry up!

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.400
You monster!!

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:55.480
He’s so cold and ruthless!
Then, when it comes to Akasaka-san…

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:58.990
Akasaka-san, everyone is so mean.

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:00.490
Ah, just in time.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:04.260
This is my new creation, would you like to try it?

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:09.220
He’s so good at avoiding the main issue!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:17.400
Somehow I… I’m afraid I’m being abused by everyone!

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:19.220
To be exact,

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.150
they’re just using me as a servant.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.450
This is all wrong!

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:25.660
Fighting…

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.910
Working…

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:27.910
Looking…

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.160
Fighting… and working again.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:34.110
I’m the one doing all the work.

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:37.820
Something is definitely WRONG HERE!

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:40.130
Today, for sure, I must talk to them!

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:45.080
Now is the time to act!
I’ll go to the Café now!

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.170
I have to tell them…

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:53.520
Oh! You’ve arrived
at the right moment.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.520
I have to say it… tell them…

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.360
I have to express myself.

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:03.840
Wahhhh… It’s happening all over again.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.110
Excuse me?

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.570
Yessssss!

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:08.930
What a hardworking girl.

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:10.910
She’s just oversimple.

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:15.440
Did you hear the rumor?

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:22.490
There’s a ghost of a young woman who wanders in the school at night.

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:25.380
Ah, that girl…

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:30.410
The swimming pool dried up mysteriously! The water taps turned on by themselves!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.460
We have a lot of weird happenings at school lately.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:34.220
They say it’s because of that ghost!

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:35.840
What’s wrong?

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:39.150
Oh, they’re students from Okumura Junior High.

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:43.360
By the way, we have something to ask you…

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:44.610
Eh!?

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.720
Why don’t you take a look, Retasu?

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:51.440
…and take a picture of it.

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.580
Make sure you don’t come back
without taking it…

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.310
But I…

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:59.570
I know you’d never say you didn’t want to, right?

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:02.590
Sure. We’re friends, right?

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:09.890
Thank you for waiting. Here is the mayonnaise and ketchup parfait!

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:12.550
We didn’t order anything like that.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.310
Oh no! My hand slipped.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.400
What the hell are you doing?

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.900
I’m so sorry!!

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:25.150
You bitch!

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:35.160
You idiot!

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:35.910
Excuse me,

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:40.420
please forgive my employee’s clumsiness.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:45.380
Wahh, he’s so handsome!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:49.340
Oh it’s nothing… it’s no big deal.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:52.170
Is that so? I’m glad.

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:58.340
Please come with me and we’ll clean up your clothes.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:07.890
Um, err…

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:14.410
Sorry for being nosy, but I couldn’t put up with it, and I acted without thinking…

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.370
It’s ok.

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:22.820
But why are you always with them?
They don’t seem to treat you very well.

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:30.340
I’m not so sure, but…
I guess they’re having a hard time…

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:39.270
I suppose they criticize me in order to drive away their own sadness…

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:42.100
Maybe they and I will be good friends someday,

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:47.020
when they pour out their own troubles and ask me for my advice.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:49.400
She’s a good person.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:52.450
So, I’m going to do what I can for them a little longer.

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:54.410
I see.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:56.810
My name is Momomiya Ichigo.

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:58.560
I’m Midorikawa Retasu.

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.190
Retasu, let’s go.

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:02.600
Well, bye for now.

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:13.790
“I’m going to do what I can”…?

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.630
I’m quite sure!

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:23.050
You might think their ghost story is just a silly school rumor, but it’s not!

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:28.070
I bet it’s another Chimera Anima who uses water.

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:30.670
So after work let’s…

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:31.490
No.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:32.700
Huh?

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:33.930
No.

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.330
I’m scared.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:38.900
Huh?

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:40.650
Nope.

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:42.040
Huh?

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:45.700
No, I’m scared… No… I’m scared!

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.040
Ghosts are scary… NO~!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.000
Why are you being so childish?

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.280
ARRHHGGGGGG!!

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:57.440
I hate ghosts!! I hate ghosts!! I hate ghosts…!!

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:02.800
I HATE GHOSTS!!!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:25.000
I’ll… slip… out of… here…

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.460
Ichigo.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:31.670
M-M-MINTO!! What are you doing here?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:35.760
I thought you might try to sneak out of the back door.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.140
Come on. Let’s get going.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.220
And… Where are we going?

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:44.140
Okumura Junior High of course!

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:50.570
No, I’m going home. I’m going home!

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:51.970
Do you insist?

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:53.110
I insist.

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:55.490
Then I guess it can’t be helped.

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:57.030
YES!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:01.740
I’ll just have to tie a leash on you
and drag you there.

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:11.420
Ghosts are scary, yes,
but even so…

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:15.380
But you really didn’t have to tie a leash on me you know!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.340
This is Okumura Junior High.

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.010
We’re going in…

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:31.520
The pool is this way, right?

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:35.190
I’m scared. I hate ghosts. What should I do if it comes out all of a sudden?

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:38.940
Ahhh! What’s over there?!

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:42.950
There is an eerie voice
coming from there!

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:47.500
{YAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH~}I can’t see! I’m scared! Minto!!!

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:55.330
Sorry, it must have been just my imagination.

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:56.710
I know you did that on purpose…

00:10:57.250 --> 00:11:00.080
Well, joking aside,

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.180
let’s check the swimming pool first.

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:09.880
I don’t see anything here. There’s also no response from Masha.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:12.810
There’s nothing here!
Why don’t we go home?

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:18.150
In this situation, we have to check the schoolhouse carefully.

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:20.610
I knew this would happen.

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:55.760
It’s weird.

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:56.930
What is?

00:11:56.930 --> 00:12:01.770
We’ve looked everywhere possible, but there’s no sign of anything.

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:05.940
That’s just because… you see, there’re no ghost over here.

00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:11.040
Stupid, we’re looking for Chimera Animas not ghosts, aren’t we?

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:17.670
What is it?

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:19.210
That’s…

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:26.250
It’s water.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:27.340
Water?

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:35.600
It’s here!

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:46.610
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:16.310
Wait up!

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:18.510
Ichigo, Ichigo!

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:20.730
I hate scary things!

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:23.690
There’s a Chimera Anima!

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:27.820
Ghosts are scary… eh?
Chimera Anima?

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:30.870
Over there! Over there!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:36.290
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:15.000
Heh…

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.340
Minto!?

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.590
Ichigo, you’re late.

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:30.920
Sorry for the delay.

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:35.210
Hey, you monster! How dare you scare me by pretending to be a ghost!

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.630
I don’t think it was trying to do that…

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:41.310
I won’t forgive you for trying to take advantage of people’s weaknesses.

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:46.320
For the Earth’s future,
I’ll be of service. ~Nya!

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:49.570
You’re such a show-off.

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:56.660
MintonArrow!

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:07.300
Reborn… Mint Echo!

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:16.390
Did it!

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:20.390
Wait, that was way too easy for a Chimera Anima.

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:28.030
Don’t tell me, it’s a real ghost?!

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:35.730
That’s the girl from this morning.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:36.740
Retasu!

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:44.960
Take a look at her costume…

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:46.920
Don’t tell me… Is she…?

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.090
She’s one of us!

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.630
LettasTanets!

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:06.570
Reborn… Lettuce Rush!!!

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:11.980
Minto!?

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:13.650
Why…?

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:17.080
Why are you attacking
your companions?

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.660
You’re next.

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:21.620
Stop it, Retasu!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:26.960
Reborn… Lettuce RUSH!

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:32.260
I won’t miss next time.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:36.590
What should I do? What should I do?!

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:42.520
Reborn… Lettuce RUSH!

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:47.100
I don’t have any choice.

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:49.810
StrawberBell!

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:58.870
Retasu…

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:07.240
You’re scared, aren’t you?

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:08.920
You’re really scared!

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:11.880
You don’t know how to react.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.670
That’s why you’re doing this!

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:16.100
You’re mistaken.

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.250
I’m not!

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:22.560
Retasu is really a good and kind person.
She wouldn’t do something like this.

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:26.100
I’ve had enough! I can’t take it anymore!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.520
Reborn…

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.020
Stop it!

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:32.980
How long are you going to sulk like that?

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:39.160
Are you going to spend your whole life in a shell?

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:47.570
I… I just wanted to get along with everybody…

00:17:47.570 --> 00:17:50.630
But I found out that my body is weird.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:54.590
I can’t make any friends for life, no matter what!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:58.920
Don’t worry. I know you’re having a hard time. Come here.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.340
Come on,

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:07.090
why are you saying that? Why do you think of yourself like that?

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:09.400
Do you think you may hurt other people because of that?

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:23.120
Reborn Strawberry…

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:25.700
Ichigo!

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.340
CHECK!

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.090
Why?

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:45.100
I killed her…

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:49.670
I killed who you were,
the shy and timid girl.

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:55.220
So don’t say you can’t make friends any more, okay?

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:57.720
Since we’re…

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:00.380
already friends, right? ~Nya!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:01.740
Wait, I can’t swim!

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:07.030
Sorry!

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.070
It’s okay.

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:13.130
Idiots. But I guess you’re both right.

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:21.180
And that’s how we gained
a new teammate.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:26.180
A lot of things have happened, but it was good to find a new friend.

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:33.090
I guess my work in the Café will get easier too…

00:19:33.090 --> 00:19:34.940
Ichigo, there’s an alien.

00:19:35.390 --> 00:19:36.110
Huh?

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:37.770
There’s an alien.

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:43.100
You’re saying it again.
Didn’t you make a mistake yesterday?

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:45.020
But there is, there is!

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:47.320
Is this thing broken?

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:48.080
There is!

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:53.830
I just wanted to check out the people who oppose our plans.

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:56.050
But I’m actually pretty fond of you.

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:07.260
Who the heck are you?

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:11.480
My name is Quiche. Thanks for the kiss!

00:20:12.760 --> 00:20:13.940
My… my…

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:16.730
Take it as my greeting for today.

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:19.520
Ichigo, Ichigo!

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:28.230
Why did I have to be kissed by that… that!!!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:30.060
But more importantly, who was he?

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:33.610
Ahhh! My precious first kiss!

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:40.240
I won’t count this as the first!
The only person I love is Aoyama-kun!

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:42.700
Aoyama-kun, I love you!!!

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:46.420
…suki suki suki suki suki kisu ……kiss?

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:50.540
Next: A Tearful Date;
The secret I can’t tell Aoyama-kun.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:53.390
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll be of service ~nya!
